  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2005201524}
  m_Text: 'Computer Product Manual


    Before opening, disconnect power. Trace
    the external power cable to the PSU and main connector. Identify the motherboard
    power connector, reconnect it, then press the power button for the neutral device
    test.'
